.SS __ABI__LITTLE_ENDIAN__
.IP
.EX
#define __ABI__LITTLE_ENDIAN__
.EE
.PP
Defined when the target architecture uses little\-endian byte order
(least significant byte stored first).
.PP
Example:
.IP
.EX
  Input         Output
0xABCDEF12 \-> 0x12EFCDAB
.EE
.PP
