.SS __ABI__BIG_ENDIAN__
.IP
.EX
#define __ABI__BIG_ENDIAN__
.EE
.PP
Defined when the target architecture uses big\-endian byte order (most
significant byte stored first).
.IP
.EX
  Input         Output
0xABCDEF12 \-> 0xABCDEF12
.EE
.PP
